### 27. 失败回调 → 自动退款(状态置"已退款", 金币退回)
POST {{baseUrl}}/backend/ai/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{ "provider": "mock", "provider_task_id": "{{ptidC}}", "status": 4,
  "err_msg": "供应商侧生成失败(e2e模拟)", "sign": "{{signC4}}" }

> {%
client.test("失败回调被受理", function () { client.assert(response.body.code === 0, response.body.message); });
%}

### 28. 校验: 余额已退回 + 状态=5已退款
GET {{baseUrl}}/front/v1/wallet/balance
Authorization: {{token}}

> {%
